      "text": "雪山"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "2026-08-03T05:00:38.919Z",
      "role": "assistant",
      "text": "想到“雪山”，你会想象出什么地方？"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "2026-08-03T05:00:50.464Z",
      "role": "user",
      "text": "珠峰"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "2026-08-03T05:00:52.584Z",
      "role": "assistant",
      "text": "珠峰的景象很壮观。你觉得这是哪个季节呢？"
