      "text": "NO"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "2026-08-03T05:05:38.684Z",
      "role": "assistant",
      "text": "有什么是这个场景里必须保留下来的？"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "2026-08-03T05:05:48.047Z",
      "role": "user",
      "text": "雪"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "2026-08-03T05:05:49.857Z",
      "role": "assistant",
      "text": "有什么是你不想让它出现在这里的？"
